  (text "→ Vibrato/Tremolo networks" (at 185 148.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "589b76ef-9c40-48a9-8d0e-443ee37103cf"))
  (text "The two-position TONE network, the five-section phase-shift ladder, the ECC82" (at 16 172 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "f4d7a159-261d-49da-bae4-1a987b66c32c"))
  (text "modulator network and the ECC83 oscillator network (with Depth, Speed, the" (at 16 175.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "5a292ead-1a1b-4bca-bb45-59459698bd0b"))
  (text "fast/slow switch and the footswitch jack) are listed part by part in bom.yaml." (at 16 179.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "ccc75759-596f-4ce3-b312-53a6b85e6d75"))
  (text "The published drawing resolves their VALUES but not their interconnection, so" (at 16 182.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "eecd7220-4ba3-4ee2-b1de-efbbdba495ab"))
  (text "this sheet names the interfaces and asserts nothing further. The phase-shift" (at 16 186.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "3e7a1996-1c56-4f98-845f-1b59d36e6494"))
  (text "vibrato bends pitch rather than gating level — see notes.md." (at 16 190 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "c7d101c6-5d2d-4bc0-9eda-0375e1f12fa9"))
  (text "Phase inverter — long-tailed pair; both channels enter, at opposite grids" (at 196 31 0)
